  "text": "Recipe: Burger Patties\nCreator: Sharmila Vedam\nCategory: Burger\nIngredients: sweet potato, red potato, spinach, chickpeas, Ginger Garlic Paste, Chaat Masala, black salt, Chili powder, Turmeric powder, Black pepper powder, Garam Masala, flaxseed powder, Salt, Ezekiel bread slices\nCooking methods: boil, saute, mash, fry, air-fry\nInstructions: Dry saut\u00e9 Ginger Garlic Paste. Add cooked sweet potato, potato, spinach & chickpeas. Mash them. Add all the spices. Cook for 1-2 mins. Shape the mixture into patties. Press them down with breadcrumbs \u2014 I made breadcrumbs using Ezekiel bread slices. Pan fry the patties for a few minutes (without any oil), then air fry for about 10 mins at 350 F.\nNotes: I made breadcrumbs using Ezekiel bread slices.",
